file crates/gui/src/comments.rs
symbol next_comment
lines 0 41
hash d1a45138ce66341d
note The handler: the next comment after the last one walked to; none at all says so. A step comment opens its step through open_step, a tour comment its tour, a step comment whose step is gone its tour; a code comment opens its file in the Source view with its lines selected (or the top, where a comment whose lines are gone is drawn). Every move goes through the selection, so it is one place in back and forward. A comment whose tour or file is gone opens nothing and is shown under the count instead; the status line says which comment it is and where it is shown.

